  "id": "lambda",
  "term": "lambda",
  "definition": "Lambda refers here to an early visually evoked brain response linked to eye-movement events during visual search. In this study, the lambda response was localized to primary visual cortex (V1) and reflected early visual processing under free-viewing conditions.",
